+  # driver is written against it, so the video subsystem is the one part of SDL2
+  # that cannot build. Compositor Services supplies the drawable instead. Audio
+  # (CoreAudio), joystick, events, timers, threads, filesystem and loadso all
+  # stay on. What the joystick subsystem keeps and loses is settled a few lines
